# local-codesystem-urn-collision root
library "Root".

// Two DISTINCT local libraries — "Local One" and "Local-One" — BOTH using
// `code is`, in ONE package. R1 — the local-domain URN keys on the POLICY ID
// (package.json `name`), NOT the library name, so both libraries synthesize the
// IDENTICAL policy-id local codesystem URN and genuinely share the policy's
// single local code domain (their distinct names are irrelevant now). Their
// local codes would share a code domain and could collide, so the per-policy
// preflight in imports/emit.ts must fail with
// `emit-local-codesystem-urn-collision`.

include "Local One".
include "Local-One".
